      "statement": "Preview agent and AI APIs are suppressed with file-level pragmas that name the rule and reason — MAAI001 and MEAI001 in AgentRole, ImplementationAgent, and ImplementSpec, OPENAI001 plus MEAI001 in ProviderResolver — and the same two pragmas are repeated in the test file that asserts on HarnessAgentOptions, keeping the suppression next to the API surface that needs it.",
