      "id": "claim_1e2aeca933e94ca98d85bda88d43d151",
      "statement": "The repository has no NoWarn entries and exactly two SuppressMessage attributes (CA1031 on JobQueue.ExecuteAsync and CA1812 on SebastianConfig); it also contains no trim/AOT suppressions (UnconditionalSuppressMessage, DynamicallyAccessedMembers, RequiresUnreferencedCode), no Activator, and no direct System.Text.Json usage, because AOT safety is achieved structurally rather than by silencing analyzers.",
